Static fields are inherited: `Post.instances` looks up the prototype chain and finds `Model.instances`, so every subclass pushes into the same array. Fix it by keeping a registry keyed by class name and having each subclass register itself in a `static { }` block, which runs once when the class is defined, with `this` set to that class.

