  static registry = {};
  static prepare(model) { Model2.registry[model.name] ??= []; }
}
class Comment extends Model2 {
  static { Model2.prepare(this); } // this === Comment
}
```

Static initialization blocks are standard since ES2022 and work in all current browsers and Node.

