posts.select('id', 'title'); // [{ id: 1, title: 'A post' }, ...]
```

`super.map` calls `Array.prototype.map` even if the class later overrides `map`. Returning a `RecordSet` keeps results chainable. `select` is the in-memory version of choosing columns in SQL (`SELECT id, title`).

