Interaction: `:hover`, `:active`, `:focus`, and `:focus-visible` (keyboard-style focus only). Link history: `:link`, `:visited` (or `:any-link` for both). Position: `:first-child`, `:last-child`, `:nth-child()`, `:nth-last-child()`. Excluding: `:not()`. Form validity: `:valid`, `:invalid`, `:user-invalid`, `:required`, `:disabled`, `:checked`.

```css
li:not(:last-child) { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid; }
input:user-invalid { border-color: #b00020; }
.field:has(input:required) label::after { content: " *"; }
```

