A state update happened **after** the test stopped waiting, typically from a promise, timer, or fetch that resolved later, so your assertions ran before the UI settled. Fix it by awaiting the change the user would see, using `findBy*` queries or `waitFor`, not by wrapping code in `act` yourself.

